id=km6fod
name=KM6 Under-Display Fingerprint (AIDL HAL)
version=v1.7.0
versionCode=17000
author=limonjil
license=GPL-3.0-only
description=Silead GSL7002 under-display fingerprint for the Tecno Spark 40 Pro (KM6) on GSI. Touch the sensor on the lockscreen and the HAL wakes the panel, arms HBM after it settles and unlocks without a second tap. Self-contained AIDL v5 HAL with verified HBM readback, kernel uevent injection, serialized vendor calls, lazy sensor open, and a supervisor that resets HBM if the HAL dies. Patches the device's own libsl_fp_impl.so at boot after verifying the site; ships no kernel modules and injects no input keys. Checked on Android 15 / 4 KB / Magisk 31.1; Android 16-17 is built for but not verified, KernelSU and APatch are not supported.
